{"title":"Mathematical puzzle","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_puzzle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1568812019/artofproblems-20\">Mathematical Puzzles: A Connoisseur's Collection</a> by Peter Winkler.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/156881206X/artofproblems-20\">Puzzles 101: A Puzzlemaster's Challenge</a> by Nobuyuki Yoshigahara.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Online\">Online</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_puzzle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Online\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=337\">Puzzles and Brainteasers Forum</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=360\">Math &amp; Strategy Games Forum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cut-the-knot&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cut-the-knot (page does not exist)\">Cut-the-knot</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cut-the-knot.org/games.shtml\">scores of educational math puzzles and games</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_puzzle&amp;action=edit&am